msgid "步行 / 骑车：WASD 移动 · 开车：W 加速 S 刹车 A/D 变道 · 空格闯红灯 · ESC 暂停 · F11 全屏"
msgstr "Walk / Bike: WASD to move · Drive: W gas, S brake, A/D change lanes · Space: run a red light · ESC pause · F11 fullscreen"

msgid "[center][font_size=36][color=#ffd23f]游戏规则[/color][/font_size][/center]\n[color=#7CFC00]目标[/color]　步行 / 骑车：每关 60 秒，沿没有非机动车道的人行道往前走，被撞 3 次失败。\n[color=#7CFC00]开车[/color]　按每关真实路段的车道、限速、公交专用道设计：60 秒内开到目的地，W 加速 S 刹车 A/D 变道。\n[color=#7CFC00]操作[/color]　WASD / 方向键 / 手柄移动，空格闯红灯，ESC 暂停，F11 全屏。\n[color=#ffd23f]电鸡[/color]　迎面逆行、身后超车（[color=#ff5252]红三角 + 嘀嘀声[/color]预警）、蛇形、钻车缝、店门口 / 路边冲出、急刹后变路障。\n[color=#ffd23f]路障[/color]　地铁口、共享单车、停着的电鸡、石墩、摊位、违停车、施工围挡都是实心的，撞上要扣命。\n[color=#ffd23f]红绿灯[/color]　步行红灯时画面停下等绿灯；开车要自己刹停在停止线前。占用公交专用道会持续扣分。\n[color=#ff5252]闯红灯[/color]　步行在路缘前[color=#ffcc80]按住 ↑ 半秒或按空格[/color]硬闯，开车直接冲线：[color=#ff5252]扣当前分数 25%[/color]，在路口里[color=#ff5252]被车撞到直接 GAME OVER[/color]。\n[color=#00b8d4]得分[/color]　坚持越久 / 开得越远分越高，擦身而过 +50，通关每条剩余的命 +300。\n[color=#00b8d4]评级[/color]　S 零失误 · A 被撞 1 次 · B 通关 · C 失败。[color=#7CFC00]通关前一关才能解锁下一关[/color]，广州、深圳共 12 关。\n[color=#ff8a80]无敌模式[/color]　主页打开后不掉血、无视红灯，撞到的电鸡全部[color=#ffd23f]创飞[/color]（每只 +100），成绩不计入存档。"
msgstr "[center][font_size=36][color=#ffd23f]How to Play[/color][/font_size][/center]\n[color=#7CFC00]Goal[/color]  Walk / Bike: each level lasts 60 s. Keep moving along a sidewalk with no bike lane; get hit 3 times and you fail.\n[color=#7CFC00]Drive[/color]  Each level uses the real road's lanes, speed limit and bus lanes: reach the destination within 60 s. W gas, S brake, A/D change lanes.\n[color=#7CFC00]Controls[/color]  WASD / arrow keys / gamepad to move, Space to run a red light, ESC to pause, F11 for fullscreen.\n[color=#ffd23f]E-bikes[/color]  Wrong-way riders head-on, overtakers from behind ([color=#ff5252]red triangle + beep[/color] warning), weavers, gap-squeezers, ones bursting out of shops / the curb, and sudden stoppers that become obstacles.\n[color=#ffd23f]Obstacles[/color]  Metro exits, shared bikes, parked e-bikes, stone bollards, stalls, illegally parked cars and construction barriers are all solid. Hit one and you lose a life.\n[color=#ffd23f]Lights[/color]  When walking, the screen stops at red until it turns green; when driving, you must stop at the line yourself. Driving in the bus lane keeps costing points.\n[color=#ff5252]Red lights[/color]  On foot, [color=#ffcc80]hold ↑ for half a second or press Space[/color] at the curb to force your way across; in a car, just floor it: [color=#ff5252]you lose 25% of your current score[/color], and [color=#ff5252]getting hit by a car in the junction is instant GAME OVER[/color].\n[color=#00b8d4]Score[/color]  The longer you survive / the farther you drive, the higher your score. Near miss +50, each life left at the finish +300.\n[color=#00b8d4]Rank[/color]  S no mistakes · A hit once · B cleared · C failed. [color=#7CFC00]Clear a level to unlock the next[/color] — 12 levels across Guangzhou and Shenzhen.\n[color=#ff8a80]Invincible Mode[/color]  Turn it on from the main menu: no damage, ignore red lights, every e-bike you hit gets [color=#ffd23f]sent flying[/color] (+100 each). Scores aren't saved."

